REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : THE CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC MODEL FOR THE MLEP          
REMARK   3  -RCRH2:MLEPTIN:MLEP-R_IGCRH2' COMPLEX (PDB 7Z3R) WAS FITTED IN      
REMARK   3  THE CRYO-EM MAP USING CHIMERA AND REAL-SPACE REFINED IN PHENIX      
REMARK   3  USING REFERENCE RESTRAINTS TO THE STARTING MODEL.                   
REMARK   3                                                                      
